---
// src/components/bangalore/HowItWorks.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-white w-full">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
        How it works
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative">
      <!-- Connection Line (Desktop only) -->
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-12 left-[15%] right-[15%] h-1 bg-slate-900 z-0"></div>

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 text-center bg-white p-6 border border-slate-200 rounded-md shadow-xl">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 text-3xl font-black text-white">
          1
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3">You send us one month</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-800 font-bold">
          Your payment reports, your order data, and the bank statement for that account. That is all.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 text-center bg-white p-6 border border-slate-200 rounded-md shadow-xl">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-emerald-500 border border-slate-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">
          2
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3">We go through it line by line</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-800 font-bold mb-4">
          Every order matched to the payment. Every payment matched to your bank.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-900 font-black uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-400 border border-slate-300 inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded shadow-md">
          Done by our CA team, not by a tool.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 text-center bg-emerald-500 p-6 border border-slate-200 rounded-md shadow-xl">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">
          3
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3">You get your report back</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold mb-4">
          Every wrong charge, with the order number next to it.
        </p>
        <p class="text-white font-black bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 rounded inline-block shadow-md">
          We raise the claim for whatever should not have gone.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
